===== CLI commands via --help =====
                                                                                
 Usage: skillgate [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...                                   
                                                                                
 Skill Gate — evaluate agent skills. Pack on disk + `skillgate check` (exit     
 0/1).                                                                          
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --help          Show this message and exit.                                  │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭─ Commands ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ version  Print the CLI version.                                              │
│ ingest   Validate a skill folder against the agentskills spec.               │
│ check    Run pack-local evals/cases.yaml. Exit 0 if green, 1 if red. No      │
│          account required.                                                   │
│ run      Run an eval pack or suite YAML. Prefer `skillgate check` for CI.    │
│ deploy   Copy a skill pack into a local agent skills directory.              │
│ list     Show skills/ and evals/ (skill-first paths).                        │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯


